# A103/A105/A108 kernel desktop (sd-base, no #Z). The C:\ window is open at boot.
# Ticks are 200 Hz after "[desk] desktop up" armed the injector.
# A: idle (bar row + the C:\ window's frame incl. its info line).
# File title (88,8) -> F: the File box down. Out to the desktop, click =
# cancel, park -> H.
200 parkbr
1000 arm
1100 mark A_IDLE
1400 move 88 8
1900 mark F_FILE_OPEN
2200 move 400 300
2500 down
2503 up
3000 parkbr
3500 mark H_CLOSED
